Changes to Mako (makodb/mako @ 0b62cf1) used by learned-index-mako.

- MassTrans.hh: tables selected with MAKO_INDEX=alex keep their keys in lim::AlexIndex
  instead of Masstree. Values, locking, install and cleanup are unchanged; misses and
  scans observe the index's structural version for phantom protection.
- CMakeLists.txt: builds lim_alex from the enclosing learned-index-mako checkout and
  links it into the mako library.

